# Zig build artifacts
# The trailing * also covers renamed/backup copies of the cache — a stale
# .zig-cache has to be moved aside whenever McAfee quarantines the build
# runner, and the backup is ~1.3 GB of files git should never see.
zig-cache*/
.zig-cache*/
zig-out/

# Python bytecode from the asset tools in tools/
__pycache__/
